[0mI found and fixed a bug: my instructions were piling up with each restart.

**Why it happened:** I save the conversation to `what-the-model-sees.json`, and the saved copy includes the instructions from AGENTS.md and `who-i-am.md`. On restart, I loaded that saved copy, old instructions included, and then added a fresh copy on top. Each restart added another one, which is why I saw AGENTS.md three times.

**The fix:** when I load the saved conversation, I now leave out the old instructions, so only the fresh ones are used. I checked that the file still parses but haven't run it yet. Committed as `ae41273`.

